Super Typhoon Bawei is about to land

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,240
Warn residents to close doors and windows in advance

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,400
Clean up debris on the maintenance table

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,440
Far from the seaside curtain billboard

6
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,360
Underground roads and temporary structures

7
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,800
Do not go out unless necessary during a typhoon

8
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:20,250
Can I fly in strong wind?

9
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,890
Xiaopi, it's dangerous outside

10
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:29,470
Let's go home first

11
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,670
Attention all students

12
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:31,670
Typhoon Bawei blocked

13
