14
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:35,310
Students in dormitories on the second floor and above

15
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,070
Press P4 to transfer to the underground locomotive yard

16
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:39,110
Students moved to the dormitory on the second floor to avoid danger

17
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,950
Seal the doors and windows and you are not allowed to leave the dormitory.

18
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,470
Go to the garage from the second floor above

19
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,430
Ground return warning

20
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,470
Register first on the second floor and above

21
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:45,950
Don't worry, come one by one

22
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,750
Those on the first and second floors can go back to the dormitory first.

23
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:49,270
Close the doors and windows and don't run around

24
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:55,600
Register here from the second floor and above

25
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,120
It's so exciting, guys.

26
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:00,200
We feel a bit like surviving in the wilderness. We are in the same dormitory.

27
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,800
Braving a Category 17 typhoon

28
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,040
It's really cool

29
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,160
The group urged me again

30
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,320
Anyone above the second floor should evacuate immediately.

31
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,800
Anyone who has not come down must go down.

32
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,360
It's okay. Pan Zi, turn off the light.

33
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:13,750
Come in and play cards, Panzi

34
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:19,810
The wind is wrong

35
00:01:19,810 --> 00:01:24,310
It looks like a monster is breathing

36
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:25,310
Don't open the window

37
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,310
Just open it a little

38
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,630
I just want to feel the typhoon

39
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:28,830
feel nature

40
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:30,590
Only in this way can the world feel real

41
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:42,020
Blocking several lamps

42
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,230
Come and see

43
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:45,920
What a monster?

44
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:48,870
It was right there just now, really

45
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,910
Fuck, I saw it.

46
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:50,950
what did you see

47
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:53,110
What's the matter? Tell me quickly.

48
00:01:53,110 --> 00:01:54,430
I saw a dragon

49
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:57,730
There really are dragons in this world

50
00:01:57,730 --> 00:02:17,130
Come over and play cards

51
00:02:17,130 --> 00:02:19,090
It must have been announced on the radio before the typhoon arrived.

52
00:02:19,090 --> 00:02:21,610
The eye of the typhoon will pass over the school, maybe because the wind is too strong

53
00:02:21,610 --> 00:02:23,060
Broken the wire

54
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:24,020
I don't want to take a shower yet

55
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:25,220
This is too dark, right?

56
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:31,420
If I had known earlier, I would have taken the car underground and taken a rest.

57
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,700
Hey Pan Zi, where are you spreading?

58
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:35,540
No reply even after sending messages. Brother Dog, we didn’t come down.

59
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,260
There is a power outage in the dormitory now. Ask him about the heavy power bank

60
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:39,760
Is your Chongdian Bao in the dormitory, Brother Dog?

61
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,840
Hello Pan Zi

62
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:43,360
No signal again

63
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,940
No signal again

64
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:47,380
The dormitory building opposite also had a power outage, right?

65
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:48,340
The typhoon is coming

66
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:49,340
The motivation should be greater

67
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:51,660
Why is it so urgent now not to go to the dormitory next door?

68
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:56,180
Take out a heavy electronic treasure

69
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:57,420
What's going on?

70
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:59,290
What are these things on the wall?

71
00:02:59,290 --> 00:03:01,010
Who did the prank?

72
00:03:01,010 --> 00:03:12,820
This doesn't look like it was posted on it either.

73
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:13,820
Contact the instructor first

74
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:19,010
The message can't be sent out either.

75
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,850
Wasn't it just six or seven o'clock in the evening?

76
00:03:20,850 --> 00:03:25,490
Why is it that it’s already eleven o’clock and I still can’t get out?

77
00:03:25,490 --> 00:03:28,410
It's very quiet outside

78
00:03:28,410 --> 00:03:30,660
Why don't we go out and take a look?

79
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:31,620
It's like a ghost movie outside

80
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:32,660
Don't go out

81
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:35,540
There's no way to stay here. There's no signal and the phone's battery is about to run out.

82
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:37,180
Why don't we go downstairs to find the main force?

83
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:42,160
But remember to lighten the fire

84
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,480
I run very slowly

85
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,400
Don't be afraid Panzi

86
00:03:44,400 --> 00:04:20,170
Be brothers in our hearts

87
00:04:20,170 --> 00:04:21,250
almost died

88
00:04:21,250 --> 00:04:30,860
The monster in that game

89
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:36,710
This monster just now

90
00:04:36,710 --> 00:04:37,630
We were in a typhoon before

91
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:38,670
See that one is exactly the same

92
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:40,390
The lantern on the head is also real or fake

93
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:43,910
If you didn't believe me at the time, I said I saw the phone and couldn't make a call, and the time was wrong.

94
00:04:43,910 --> 00:04:45,790
Is there another monster now?

95
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:47,590
Don't say that when we get to another time

96
00:04:47,590 --> 00:04:48,870
The more you talk about it, the scarier it becomes

97
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:50,110
Stop thinking about it first

98
00:04:50,110 --> 00:04:51,910
Let's go to bed and take a nap first

99
00:04:51,910 --> 00:04:55,150
Stay up until dawn and then say okay. Block the door first and stop it quickly.

100
00:04:55,150 --> 00:04:57,060
Resist me and get stuck

101
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:58,920
Why can't I get through to the teacher again?

102
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,400
The three of them are still in the dormitory and their phones can't be reached now. They are still in the dormitory.

103
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,360
Yes, I called you just now

104
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,360
Lost contact now

105
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,480
Don't worry if you don't know what happened.

106
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,000
Many buildings in the school are now without power.

107
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,680
I arranged for people from the Security Office to go up and see the teacher.

108
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:13,920
Why don't I go with them? Okay, please be safe and grab a few more flashlights and don't drop them.

109
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,960
Go to 33-666

110
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:17,490
Confirm the situation of Sanmi students

111
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:18,410
It's all Xiaolong's fault

112
00:05:18,410 --> 00:05:19,410
You have to brave the typhoon weather

113
00:05:19,410 --> 00:05:20,810
Stay in the hostel big name

114
00:05:20,810 --> 00:05:22,530
I almost died just now

115
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:24,490
Stop saying a few words and clear the plate first.

116
00:05:24,490 --> 00:05:25,730
What is going on now?

117
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:26,890
figure it out

118
00:05:26,890 --> 00:05:29,760
how to figure it out

119
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:37,420
Little Big Big Little Dragon

120
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,580
Let's get that thing sorted out first.

121
00:05:38,580 --> 00:05:39,620
Meet the dogs and the others downstairs

122
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,900
Don't be impulsive

123
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:43,340
Linhai University Typhoon Detention Rules

124
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:45,300
Rules are only broadcast once

125
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:46,260
Article 1

126
00:05:46,260 --> 00:05:47,540
before twelve o'clock

127
00:05:47,540 --> 00:05:49,420
Go to the black box next to the fire cabinet in the corridor

128
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,900
Retrieve house number 606

129
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,620
Otherwise after twelve o'clock

130
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:54,380
The door can't stop what's outside

131
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:55,940
Isn't this just a strange bullet from the rules?

132
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:59,940
I've seen this kind of video before. What kind of cards are used to do it? It's over. Calm down first.

133
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:01,460
We need to figure out where the fire cabinet is first.

134
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:02,460
Which end should I go through?

135
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:05,080
How long is it until twelve o'clock? Listen to what he means

136
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,200
If you don't get the house number after twelve o'clock

137
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,370
Monsters can come in, right?

138
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:11,110
That monster was made by humans. There really is a monster.

139
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,070
Why do you still have such weird rules?

140
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:13,710
Fire game

141
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:15,510
That seems to make sense

142
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:16,590
I guess it’s a TV station

143
00:06:16,590 --> 00:06:17,630
Make total profit for the whole stock

144
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,950
Specially scary kind

145
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,030
Maybe it's cooperating with the school, maybe it's like

146
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:22,350
There is indeed such a video

147
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:23,670
No matter if it’s a drama or not

148
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:24,670
Everyone has to be cautious

149
00:06:24,670 --> 00:06:26,670
Our usual life is magical enough

150
00:06:26,670 --> 00:06:28,070
Something magical happened

151
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:30,810
Instead it doesn’t feel fake

152
00:06:30,810 --> 00:06:32,610
Pan Zi, why don’t you come down, Brother Long?

153
00:06:32,610 --> 00:06:33,570
It doesn’t matter if it’s a person or an armor.

154
00:06:33,570 --> 00:06:37,500
Let's find something for self-defense first so that we feel a little safer.

155
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:38,620
This works

156
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:52,470
Let's change Brother Long

157
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:53,470
I have trouble using the keyboard

158
00:06:53,470 --> 00:06:54,670
I'd better use a stick

159
00:06:54,670 --> 00:06:58,300
Change with me

160
00:06:58,300 --> 00:06:59,460
thank you

161
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,540
It's useless if you hold a stick

162
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:05,180
If I hold it, I can still protect you. Stop laughing.

163
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:06,740
It's twelve o'clock in fifteen minutes

164
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:08,780
You have to go to the fire cabinet to get the black box.

165
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:10,100
Right, right, right

166
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:11,380
You go, I won't go

167
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:12,300
I went to bed

168
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:13,580
Pan Zi, don’t be like this

169
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,100
Can I protect you for a while?

170
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,940
Let's go then, Panzi

171
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:18,620
Don't be angry, Pan Zi

172
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:21,930
Not much left

173
00:07:21,930 --> 00:07:23,450
Let's move this table away first, okay?

174
00:07:23,450 --> 00:07:24,540
Move the table

175
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:26,060
Get the keyboard quickly

176
00:07:26,060 --> 00:08:19,650
The fire cabinet is on the right side of the corridor

177
00:08:19,650 --> 00:08:20,690
I turn on the timer

178
00:08:20,690 --> 00:08:22,380
Add a table

179
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:23,340
Xiaolong, look to the left

180
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:26,610
Pan Zi looked to the right as soon as he appeared

181
00:08:26,610 --> 00:08:27,530
Just close the door

182
00:08:27,530 --> 00:08:29,330
Just repeat it a few times and it will be considered open.

183
00:08:29,330 --> 00:08:56,660
Did you just see the chapter? Which chapter?

184
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:57,620
The dog we moved

185
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:59,180
Brother Dog has gone out long ago

186
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:04,000
Will it come out?

187
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,360
Is my student with you? Director Xiaojia, I'm too busy here.

188
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:19,750
Will reply to you soon

189
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:22,030
The monster stayed at the end of the left corridor for almost three minutes.

190
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,990
Then it will disappear for thirty seconds. The fire cabinet is on the right.

191
00:09:23,990 --> 00:09:24,950
We only have thirty seconds

192
00:09:24,950 --> 00:09:28,310
Get the black box. Go and see the house number. Come back and hang it up. You two go get it. I'll guard the left side.

193
00:09:28,310 --> 00:09:29,620
I'll capture him somewhere else

194
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:30,620
Thirty seconds more

195
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,980
How about you do the math again?

196
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:33,260
Can you stop screaming, Pan Zi?

197
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,580
Ten seconds left

198
00:09:34,580 --> 00:09:37,150
He just disappeared. Are you ready?

199
00:09:37,150 --> 00:09:52,240
I wasted a lot of time buying this look, right, right, right

200
00:09:52,240 --> 00:10:14,270
Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go back and take a walk.

201
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:16,540
Is the fire cabinet in the front?

202
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,860
i disappeared

203
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:22,430
I disappeared and can't see clearly

204
00:10:22,430 --> 00:10:24,870
The fire cabinet is right in front. I'm wearing slippers and it's not convenient for you to go get it quickly.

205
00:10:24,870 --> 00:10:27,040
OK OK

206
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,560
Where is the black box? Where is it?

207
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,600
You are blind

208
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,080
On your head

209
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:34,220
Okay, I saw you. Wait for me, right away.

210
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:36,380
Come on, come on, come on, I got it

211
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:38,180
Come over as soon as you get it

212
00:10:38,180 --> 00:11:53,270
Remember to put on your shoes

213
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:57,550
Less things to do

214
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:59,070
The monsters inside and outside heard me

215
00:11:59,070 --> 00:12:36,300
No matter who is outside

216
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,540
Let's ignore him

217
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:38,660
And never open the door.

218
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:40,380
What if the broadcast is fake?

219
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:42,940
Just trying to trap us in the dormitory

220
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:44,180
Don't think so much first

221
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:46,060
Press the broadcast button first and don't reply.

222
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:55,450
Don't open the door either

223
00:12:55,450 --> 00:12:56,410
What are you doing?

224
00:12:56,410 --> 00:12:57,330
Calling you so many times

225
00:12:57,330 --> 00:12:58,330
Didn't answer anyone

226
00:12:58,330 --> 00:13:01,060
Talk

227
00:13:01,060 --> 00:13:03,320
What are you doing in the dormitory?

228
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:30,130
And why did this corridor become like this? Don’t believe it.

229
00:13:30,130 --> 00:13:32,110
You answer anything the outsider says

230
00:13:32,110 --> 00:13:35,350
What if not?

231
00:13:35,350 --> 00:14:32,440
Everyone, let me go up and take a look.

232
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:43,380
Made eye contact with him

233
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:44,340
We didn't open the door either

234
00:14:44,340 --> 00:15:24,140
Didn't even answer his words

235
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:30,710
It’s so hard, Xiaolong Panzi

236
00:15:30,710 --> 00:15:32,150
I didn’t see them in the dormitory

237
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:33,550
I wonder what they went to do

238
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:55,490
Ask here

239
00:15:55,490 --> 00:15:57,290
Do you know those three missing students?

240
00:15:57,290 --> 00:15:59,010
Where is the final location that can be determined?

241
00:15:59,010 --> 00:16:01,210
It should still be monitored under the dormitory building.

242
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:03,090
They were not photographed leaving the dormitory building.

243
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:04,370
I also asked other students

244
00:16:04,370 --> 00:16:07,840
No one has ever seen them spread the word

245
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,080
Zhang Jie, come here

246
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:11,410
This is the missing person's roommate

247
00:16:11,410 --> 00:16:13,330
When was the last time you contacted them?

248
00:16:13,330 --> 00:16:16,250
It was probably around seven or eight o'clock last night. Originally, there were four of us that day.

249
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:17,610
Make an appointment to play cards in the dormitory

250
00:16:17,610 --> 00:16:19,250
But wasn’t the typhoon coming at that time?

251
00:16:19,250 --> 00:16:20,330
I'm stuck in the library

252
00:16:20,330 --> 00:16:21,330
Didn't go back to the dormitory

253
00:16:21,330 --> 00:16:22,850
Did they contact you again after that?

254
00:16:22,850 --> 00:16:24,490
They called me later

255
00:16:24,490 --> 00:16:26,050
It seems to be asking for a power bank

256
00:16:26,050 --> 00:16:27,290
But the mobile phone signal is very poor

257
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:28,410
The phone calls are intermittent.

258
00:16:28,410 --> 00:16:29,410
to the back

259
00:16:29,410 --> 00:16:33,450
I can't contact them anymore. Okay, thank you for your hard work. Please go back and see if there is any situation.

260
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:34,450
I'll inform you again

261
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:57,150
Where did this Jianbao come from?
